</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 849)</h2>
<ul>
<li>The review windows have a new look. <b>Share This Review</b>, <b>Join a Review</b> and the <b>Review Manager</b> share one design: the review you host and the web link are the two cards; the passphrase and the link sit in their own key-coloured capsule with a copy button; a pill in the corner says the state with a dot &#8212; grey off, amber waiting, green live; the action that ends something is red and never the big button.</li>
<li>The windows are exactly as tall as what they show, and grow or collapse as the review changes &#8212; no empty space below the text, nothing below the fold.</li>
<li>Grayscale Interface still drains all of it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
